            "title": "Comedy, Pizza and Shots – OPEN-MIC THURSDAY",
            "description": "<p><script\n  src=\"https://www.universe.com/embed2.js\"\n  data-widget-type=\"universe-ticket\"\n  data-target-type=\"Listing\"\n  data-target-id=\"laughs-pizza-shots-english-comedy-night-in-the-heart-of-berlin-tickets-KMDNBW\"\n  data-state=\"buttonColor=#3A66E5&#038;buttonText=Get Tickets\" >\n</script></p>\n<p>Find one of the longest running English speaking comedy clubs in <strong>Berlin Prenzlauer Berg! </strong>Indulge in a fantastic evening with stand-up comedy, pizza and shots!</p>\n<p>It’s <b>Open-Mic night, </b>so professional and new comics give it ago to make you laugh.</p>\n<p><strong>Doors open at 7 PM</strong>. You will be greeted by one of our fabulous door people who give you a little introduction to the club. Get your free shot at the bar. There is always a <strong>2 for 1 drink special until 8 PM</strong>, so come early and mingle with like-minded people. At around <strong>8.15 PM vegetarian and vegan pizza</strong> from one of Berlins most popular Italian restaurants will be served at your seat. The <strong>show starts at 9 PM</strong>. Cosmic Comedy Berlin has an intermission and usually ends around 11 PM.</p>\n<p>Hosted by: <a href=\"https://dharmandersingh.com/\">Dharmander Singh</a> (GBR)</p>\n<p>★★★★★ THE ACTS ★★★★★</p>\n<p>To be announced</p>\n<p>★★★★★ OPENING TIMES ★★★★★</p>\n<p>Doors: 19:00<br />\nPizza: 20:15<br />\nShow: 21:00<br />\n2for1 on selected drinks from 19:00 until 20:00</p>",
