            "url": "https://comedyclubberlin.com/event/new-years-eve-special/",
            "title": "NEW YEAR&#8217;S EVE SPECIAL",
            "description": "<div class=\"xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs\">This show is in English!</div>\n<div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s\"><span class=\"html-span xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xm2jcoa x1mpyi22 xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"xz74otr x15mokao x1ga7v0g x16uus16 xbiv7yw\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t8c/1/16/1f389.png\" alt=\"🎉\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span> New Year’s Eve Comedy Bash! <span class=\"html-span xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xm2jcoa x1mpyi22 xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"xz74otr x15mokao x1ga7v0g x16uus16 xbiv7yw\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/tab/1/16/1f355.png\" alt=\"🍕\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span><span class=\"html-span xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xm2jcoa x1mpyi22 xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"xz74otr x15mokao x1ga7v0g x16uus16 xbiv7yw\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t4e/1/16/1f369.png\" alt=\"🍩\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span><span class=\"html-span xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xm2jcoa x1mpyi22 xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"xz74otr x15mokao x1ga7v0g x16uus16 xbiv7yw\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t19/1/16/1f37e.png\" alt=\"🍾\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span></div>\n<div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s\">Bring in the New Year with laughs, free treats, and good vibes! Join us for an unforgettable English Comedy Night featuring a fantastic lineup of comedians to keep you laughing into 2026.</div>\n<div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s\"><span class=\"html-span xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xm2jcoa x1mpyi22 xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"xz74otr x15mokao x1ga7v0g x16uus16 xbiv7yw\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/tae/1/16/1f3ad.png\" alt=\"🎭\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span> Live English Stand-Up Comedy<br class=\"html-br\" /><span class=\"html-span xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xm2jcoa x1mpyi22 xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"xz74otr x15mokao x1ga7v0g x16uus16 xbiv7yw\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/tab/1/16/1f355.png\" alt=\"🍕\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span> FREE Pizza<br class=\"html-br\" /><span class=\"html-span xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xm2jcoa x1mpyi22 xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"xz74otr x15mokao x1ga7v0g x16uus16 xbiv7yw\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t90/1/16/1f943.png\" alt=\"🥃\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span> FREE Shots<br class=\"html-br\" /><span class=\"html-span xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xm2jcoa x1mpyi22 xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"xz74otr x15mokao x1ga7v0g x16uus16 xbiv7yw\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t4e/1/16/1f369.png\" alt=\"🍩\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span> Doughnut Delights<br class=\"html-br\" /><span class=\"html-span xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xm2jcoa x1mpyi22 xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"xz74otr x15mokao x1ga7v0g x16uus16 xbiv7yw\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/tf/1/16/1f942.png\" alt=\"🥂\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span> Sparkling Wine Toast at Midnight</div>\n<div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s\">Plus, we’re handing the mic to you! Share your New Year’s resolutions with the crowd — whether they’re inspiring, silly, or downright impossible.</div>\n<div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s\">Let’s welcome the New Year with great comedy, great food, and even better company. Don’t miss the countdown!</div>\n<div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s\">Doors open at 7 PM. You will be greeted by one of our fabulous door people who give you a little introduction to the club. Get your free shot at the bar. There is always a 2 for 1 drink special until 8 PM, so come early and mingle with like-minded people. At around 8.15 PM vegetarian and vegan pizza from one of Berlins most popular Italian restaurants will be served at your seat. The show starts at 9 PM. Cosmic Comedy Berlin has an intermission and usually ends around 11 PM.</div>\n<div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s\">Host: Dharmander Singh</div>\n<div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s\">★★★★★ THE ACTS ★★★★★</div>\n<div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s\">TBA</div>\n<div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s\">★★★★★ OPENING TIMES ★★★★★</div>\n<div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s\">Doors: 19:00<br class=\"html-br\" />Pizza: 20:15<br class=\"html-br\" />Show: 21:00</div>\n<div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s\">2for1 drinks selection: between 19:00 and 20:00</div>\n<div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s\">★★★★★ THE VENUE ★★★★★</div>\n<div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s\">Cosmic Comedy Berlin – Comedyclub<br class=\"html-br\" />Schönhauser Allee 184, 10119 Berlin<br class=\"html-br\" /><a class=\"x1i10hfl xjbqb8w x1ejq31n x18oe1m7 x1sy0etr xstzfhl x972fbf x10w94by x1qhh985 x14e42zd x9f619 x1ypdohk xt0psk2 x3ct3a4 xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x16tdsg8 x1hl2dhg xggy1nq x1a2a7pz xkrqix3 x1sur9pj x1fey0fg x1s688f\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" href=\"https://bit.ly/3vOs1hH?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAc3J0YwZhcHBfaWQQMjIyMDM5MTc4ODIwMDg5MgABHlJ2RZ4ufzoglkbNgLQ0kV-JbDmnov96C6WUSVTq55KVIb7JuCYEdxRATBWU_aem_JCvCdyN_094Uz_GJRkNUbw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">https://bit.ly/3vOs1hH</a></div>",
